<title>PERU: Backus mulls 200 million sol bond issue.</title>
<headline>Backus mulls 200 million sol bond issue.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Directors of brewery group Union de Cervecerias Backus will consider authorizing a 200 million sol bond issue at a July 4 meeting, the Lima Stock Exchange said Tuesday.</p>
<p>The market's daily report did not give more details.</p>
<p>((-- Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
</text>
